---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About · Foxxe Labs" description="About Foxxe Labs.">
  <div class="card" style="max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <h1>About Foxxe Labs</h1>
    <p class="muted">
      Foxxe Labs is a small workshop where ideas become prototypes and prototypes become tools.
      The goal is simple: build things that make thinking easier, learning faster, and choices clearer.
    </p>

    <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
    <ul class="list">
      <li><strong>Tools</strong> you can share (quizzes, checklists, small interactive demos).</li>
      <li><strong>Research-adjacent prototypes</strong> that explore human-AI interaction, trust, and cognition.</li>
      <li><strong>Creative experiments</strong> that are useful even when they're strange.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What you won't find (unless a page explicitly says otherwise)</h2>
    <ul class="list">
      <li>Hidden data collection.</li>
      <li>Tracking by default.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="note">
      If a tool ever collects responses, the page will say so clearly, and will include a plain-language privacy note.
    </div>

    <h2>Start here</h2>
    <ul class="list">
      <li><a href="/tools/thinking-style-snapshot/">Thinking Style Snapshot</a></li>
      <li><a href="/tools/">Tools index</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  h2 {
    margin: 18px 0 10px 0;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }
  
  .list {
    margin: 8px 0 0 18px;
    color: #d5e2f0;
  }
  
  .note {
    border-left: 3px solid rgba(125,211,252,.55);
    padding-left: 10px;
    margin-top: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
